B.Tb=new A.nV("Pushing the schedule","You can move registration close and the start later until the first matches are generated.\n\nPush registration: the start moves by the same amount, so players keep the same gap between registration closing and the first round. You can turn that off if the start should stay put.\n\nPush start: only the start moves.\n\nTimes only move later, never earlier. Once matches exist the schedule is locked.",null,null,null)
B.aGH=new A.nV("How to read the graph",'Six stats: attack, defense, stamina, height, dash and burst resistance; a blank one counts as 0. The graph scales to this part\'s highest stat (the ring numbers show what the edge is worth), so it shows the part\'s shape. "25 \u203a 55" changes during the battle; "25 | 55" is two modes -- the dashed shape is the end, or the second mode. Weight is shown separately.',null,null,null)
B.aGI=new A.nV("Your tests","Tests are saved on this device only. Every battle you record is saved right away, so nothing is lost if the app closes.\n\nBackup (the cloud button) uploads a private copy to your account, so you can restore your tests on another phone. Nobody else can see them.",B.rK,null,null)
B.aBi=new A.a3(58245,"MaterialIcons",null,!0)
B.aGM=new A.nV("Battle log","Newest first. Each battle keeps the exact builds, stadium, launchers and side it was recorded with, so changing your setup later never changes old battles.\n\nTap a battle to fix its result, side or note.",B.aBi,null,null)
B.aGP=new A.nV("Scoring","Spin finish 1 point, Over finish 2, Burst finish 2, Xtreme finish 3. A draw scores nothing.\n\nEvery battle is saved on this device the moment you tap it.",B.xF,null,null)
B.aGS=new A.nV("How testing works","Add an opponent, then record each battle: who won and how (Spin 1, Over 2, Burst 2, Xtreme 3 points), or a draw. Each battle keeps both builds by their part ids, plus the stadium, launchers and your launch side. Records and stats are worked out from the battles you recorded.\n\nEverything is saved on this device as you go.",B.rK,null,null)
